      "name": "串記劇本",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "laboratory／observatory／dormitory／repository 場所排。refractory 難搞店。transitory 過客旅館；predatory 掠食招牌——里長：repository of logs；refractory egos 禁入。"
    },
    {
